---
import { aSharePresets, aShareRanges } from '../lib/trends/a-share';
import '../styles/a-share.css';
---
<section id="a-share-panel" class="a-share-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="a-share-title">
  <div class="a-share-heading"><h2 id="a-share-title">A股行情</h2><span class="a-share-badge">收盘历史 · 非实时</span></div>
  <div class="a-share-finder">
    <form id="a-share-search" class="a-share-search" role="search">
      <label for="a-share-query" class="a-share-sr-only">搜索常用股票名称或6位代码</label>
      <span class="a-share-search-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
      <input id="a-share-query" name="query" type="search" placeholder="名称 / 代码，如 茅台、600519" maxlength="40" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-controls="a-share-results" aria-describedby="a-share-search-help" />
      <button type="submit">查找</button>
    </form>
    <div id="a-share-results-panel" class="a-share-results-panel" hidden>
      <div class="a-share-results-heading"><p id="a-share-results-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" id="a-share-search-close" aria-label="关闭搜索结果">✕</button></div>
      <div id="a-share-results" class="a-share-results" aria-label="搜索结果"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p id="a-share-search-help" class="a-share-help">可搜{aSharePresets.length}个常用名称；其他品种输入6位代码</p>
  <div class="a-share-discovery">
    <div class="a-share-discovery-tabs" role="group" aria-label="浏览A股品种">
      <button type="button" data-a-share-group="指数" aria-pressed="true">大盘指数</button>
      <button type="button" data-a-share-group="个股" aria-pressed="false">常用个股</button>
      <button type="button" data-a-share-group="recent" aria-pressed="false">最近看过</button>
    </div>
    <div id="a-share-choices" class="a-share-choices" aria-label="大盘指数">
      {aSharePresets.filter(p=>p.type==='指数').map(p=><button type="button" data-a-share-symbol={p.symbol} aria-pressed={p.symbol==='SSE:000001'}>{p.name}</button>)}
    </div>
    <p id="a-share-recent-empty" class="a-share-help" hidden>还没有浏览记录。点一个指数，或搜索想看的股票。</p>
  </div>
  <div id="a-share-chart" class="a-share-chart" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="a-share-chart-heading"><div><h3 id="a-share-current">上证指数</h3><p id="a-share-current-code">上海 · 000001 · 指数</p></div><button type="button" id="a-share-expand" aria-pressed="false">放大图表</button></div>
    <div class="a-share-chart-controls">
      <div class="a-share-range" role="group" aria-label="A股历史区间">{aShareRanges.map(([value,label])=><button type="button" data-a-share-range={value} aria-pressed={value==='12M'}>{label}</button>)}</div>
      <label class="a-share-view-label"><span class="a-share-sr-only">图表样式</span><select id="a-share-view" aria-label="图表样式"><option value="line">收盘走势</option><option value="candles">K线图</option></select></label>
    </div>
    <div id="a-share-widget" class="a-share-widget" aria-label="A股历史收盘图表"></div>
    <div class="a-share-chart-footer"><p id="a-share-status" class="a-share-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">由 TradingView 提供。价格、日期及数据状态以图内为准。</p><button type="button" id="a-share-retry">重新加载</button></div>
    <a id="a-share-source" class="a-share-source" href="https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SSE-000001/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">图表打不开？前往 TradingView ↗</a>
  </div>
  <details class="a-share-disclosure"><summary>数据来源与使用说明</summary><p>日线历史 / EOD覆盖。上海、深圳指数与个股以收盘历史覆盖为主；更新频率、最新数值及日期以图内标注为准。休市、节假日显示最近交易记录，不作为盘中实时行情。近3月、近1年等为请求的显示范围，不保证每个品种拥有完整历史。图表周期随所选区间由供应方自动调整，实际周期以图内为准。暂不含北交所。</p><p>名称搜索是{aSharePresets.length}项常用目录，不是全市场名称搜索；无匹配时可输入6位代码。同一代码可能属于不同交易所，例如上海 000001 为上证指数，深圳 000001 为平安银行。代码可输入 SH600519、SZ000001 或 600519.SH。最近看过最多保留5项，仅保存在此浏览器。</p><p>图表由 TradingView 官方嵌入组件直接提供，并保留其署名。AI014 不抓取、存储或导出组件中的行情，不把组件价格混入本站其他数据的涨跌排名。若某个品种受限，组件会提示不可用；本页不会用模拟曲线替代。常用列表仅为查找入口，不构成推荐或投资建议。</p><p>打开A股分类后，浏览器会连接 TradingView 及其组件服务，供应方可接收页面地址、显示品种和连接所需的 IP 地址。<a href="https://www.tradingview.com/widget-docs/faq/general/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">第三方加载说明 ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.tradingview.com/widget-docs/markets/asia-pacific/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">交易所覆盖与 EOD 说明 ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.tradingview.com/policies/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TradingView 使用条款 ↗</a></p></details>
</section>
<script>import {initASharePanel} from '../lib/trends/a-share-panel'; initASharePanel();</script>
